WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.683
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind creating a classwork folder.

00:00:06.533 --> 00:00:12.741
Folder: organises related digital files. File name: helps identify a saved item.

00:00:13.617 --> 00:00:19.070
Copy: makes a second version of an item. Move: changes where an item is stored.

00:00:19.070 --> 00:00:22.342
Rename: changes the label without changing the file content.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:28.154
With an adult supervising, practise folder and file name using a computer if one is

00:00:28.154 --> 00:00:32.779
available. Without a computer, draw the screen and explain each step to a partner.
